  "description": "The Mongoose Rockadile is perfect for young mountain bikers getting into the sport. With an aluminum hardtail frame, suspension fork, and robust 24\" x 2.35\" tires on double wall rims, you'll be able to ride all day while soaking up bumps on the trail. Not owning this bike is the only thing standing between you and a trail-ripping good time.\nLightweight, durable Tectonic T1 aluminum frame and fork. Designed for riders 4'8\" to 5'6\".\n3 x 7 drivetrain with Prowheel 152 mm crank, Shimano Tourney derailleurs and Revo shifters, and aluminum hubs with 9 mm QR front and rear axles.\n24\" x 2.35\" MTB tires on aluminum double wall wheels with aluminum pull brakes.",
